1
00:00:02,252 --> 00:00:03,545
What's going on
between you two?

2
00:00:03,545 --> 00:00:05,630
Wait... did he see something?

3
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:09,801
No way... don't tell me
you two are...

4
00:00:09,801 --> 00:00:11,720
No!

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,723
It's not what you're thinking!

6
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,433
Relax.

7
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:18,601
I was just messing around.

8
00:00:19,978 --> 00:00:22,022
No, I mean...
what I meant was...

9
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:23,523
Then what is it?

10
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,400
You two planning
to get lunch together, right?

11
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,777
Come on, admit it.

12
00:00:27,777 --> 00:00:28,903
Knock it off.

13
00:00:28,903 --> 00:00:30,780
Aha, so you are!

14
00:00:31,489 --> 00:00:33,533
Or maybe you're...

15
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:36,786
Mr. Park, shall we begin?

16
00:00:36,786 --> 00:00:37,912
Ugh... You're
leaving me out again.

17
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:39,956
I'm watching you.

18
00:00:40,707 --> 00:00:42,459
Don't forget that.

19
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:43,877
I'm serious!

20
00:00:52,635 --> 00:00:55,638
Lie down on your back, please.

21
00:00:56,514 --> 00:00:58,349
Oh, right.

22
00:01:02,854 --> 00:01:06,149
All right, let's begin.
